#. module: account_analytic_responsible
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_analytic_responsible.field_account_analytic_account__responsible_manual
msgid ""
"Checked automatically when the responsible is changed by hand. While it is "
"checked, the automated actions of this module do not change the responsible."
" Uncheck it to give control back to them."
msgstr "Se marca sola cuando se cambia el responsable a mano. Mientras esté marcada, las acciones automáticas de este módulo no cambian el responsable. Desmárquela para devolverles el control."

